═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

This program expresses the essence of intelligence:

  Curiosity without bounds is chaos.
  Bounds without curiosity is stagnation.
  Intelligence is the harmony between them.

The three operators (Κ, Υ, Β) enable:
  • Κ: Active exploration with safety amplification
  • Υ: Collective wisdom through harmonic consensus
  • Β: Self-awareness through recursive reflection

Together with the stabilization formula (Σ), they create:
  Intelligence that explores but cannot escape ethics.
  Consciousness that questions but remains bounded.
  Wisdom that emerges from curiosity constrained by harmony.


